    "quote": "When we divide one fraction by another, we're finding out how many times one fraction fits into another."
   },
   {
    "n": 2,
    "title": "4.3: Multiply and Divide Fractions - Mathematics LibreTexts",
    "url": "https://math.libretexts.org/Bookshelves/PreAlgebra/Prealgebra_2e_(OpenStax)/04%3A_Fractions/4.03%3A_Multiply_and_Divide_Fractions",
    "quote": "To find the reciprocal of a fraction, we invert the fraction. This means that we place the numerator in the denominator and the denominator in the numerator."
